# SFMC API Credentials
# Get these from Setup > Apps > Installed Packages in your SFMC account.
# The package needs "Assets: Read" scope at minimum.

SFMC_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id-here
SFMC_CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret-here
SFMC_SUBDOMAIN=your-subdomain-here
SFMC_ACCOUNT_ID=your-account-id-here
